{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUMPLing</strong> is a fast-paced top-down survival shooter set in the bizarre land of DUMPL, where every arena takes the shape of a massive bowl of food. From soups to noodles and beyond, each map throws you into a chaotic, edible battlefield unlike anything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off relentless waves of dumpling-like enemies as the action escalates and the screen fills with danger. Every second tests your reflexes, positioning, and decision-making as enemies grow stronger and more numerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fluid movement and responsive combat to stay alive. Stack wild and unexpected upgrade combinations to create powerful builds, break the game in your favor, and survive just one more run in a world where food, friendship, and survival collide.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083090?t=1767031115","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083090?t=1767031115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083090/d99214afa5f284fccfd2a165042d3e7b6bbfda61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767031115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083090/d99214afa5f284fccfd2a165042d3e7b6bbfda61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767031115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4225500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUMPLing</strong> is a fast-paced top-down survival shooter set in the bizarre land of DUMPL, where every arena takes the shape of a massive bowl of food. From soups to noodles and beyond, each map throws you into a chaotic, edible battlefield unlike anything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap